{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-08-17 13:30:00', 'title': "HII'S INGALLS SHIPBUILDING AUTHENTICATES KEEL OF DESTROYER JEREMIAH DENTON (DDG 129)", 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., AUG. 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION AUTHENTICATED THE KEEL OF THE ARLEIGH BURKE-CLASS GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER JEREMIAH DENTON (DDG 129) ON TUESDAY, AUG. 16. THE SHIP'S NAME HONORS FORMER U.S. SEN. JEREMIAH DENTON JR., A VIETNAM WAR VETERAN WHO WAS AWARDED THE NAVY CROSS FOR HIS HEROISM WHILE A PRISONER OF WAR."}